<title>PERU: Peru's money base contracts 5.6 pct during August.</title>
<headline>Peru's money base contracts 5.6 pct during August.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's money base fell 5.6 percent during August to stand at 3.585 billion soles at the end of the month, Central Reserve Bank said Monday.</p>
<p>The money base ended last year at 3.658 billion soles, up from 2.672 billion soles at the start of 1995.</p>
<p>--Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134</p>
</text>
